{"title": "Toxic Secretions", "pageid": 28736, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Toxic_Secretions", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Toxic Secretions</b> is a passive feature which can cause <a href=\"/wiki/Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Madness (Condition)\">Madness</a> in an enemy making a melee attack against the user.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When an enemy makes a melee attack against the frog, they need to succeed a <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>, or succumb to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Madness (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Madness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Madness (Condition)\">Madness</a> for two turns. \n</p><p>Mad creatures lose control of themselves and become hostile to everyone around them.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Madness\"> Condition: Madness </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Madness (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Madness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Madness (Condition)\">Madness</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"CON Save (Spell save DC)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Spell_save_DC\" title=\"Dice rolls\">Spell save DC</a>)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">Hostile</a> to everyone in the vicinity.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Addled_Frog\" title=\"Addled Frog\">Addled Frog</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714211539\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1272/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11231/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2757/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 136/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 752276/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.580      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   39.580      1 -total\n 32.55%   12.882      1 Template:Cond\n 27.92%   11.050      3 Template:Icon_text\n 25.38%   10.047      2 Template:Icon_link\n 24.39%    9.653      8 Template:Trim\n 24.28%    9.611      1 Template:Condition\n 22.48%    8.897      1 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 18.30%    7.243      3 Template:Ifempty\n 